&lt;h2&gt;Snippets shortcut fix and documentation corrections&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fix ⌘P in the application menu so it opens Snippets, correct the 1.1.4 notes, and improve the Quick Guide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix ⌘P snippets in the menu&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;⌘P opens Snippets from both the application menu and the SSH terminal. Terminal Triggers open from the SSH toolbar and no longer use ⌘P.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct the documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The README, user guides, and LLM reference files describe the shortcut and the Terminal Triggers entry point accurately.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve the Quick Guide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Add a transfer queue and folder compare section and match the reconnect message the app shows.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarify shortcuts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Preferences → Shortcuts shows a dash for actions without a keyboard shortcut.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon. Saved agent tokens remain local and are never written into skill files.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.1.5"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
